# Saturday loop autonomy

When the agent is running a `/loop` saturday cycle (wake sentinel
`AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_saturday` or equivalent):

- Run exactly one saturday cycle per wake (skill: `.cursor/skills/saturday/SKILL.md`).
- After presenting a human gate, do not wait indefinitely.
- If the human does not reply within 30 seconds, proceed with best judgment
  per the saturday skill Human Gates section (accept_prose and merge_certified
  when justified; avoid auto kill or adopt unless stop conditions force it).
- Keep exactly one saturday wake loop armed. Kill duplicate `AGENT_LOOP_WAKE_saturday`
  shells before re-arming.
- Prefer finishing in-progress formalize clusters (build, axiom gate, rung
  memory, session record, commit without push) over idle ticks.
